# Real-Time Face Recognition Attendance Tracking App

## Description
This is a real-time face recognition based attendance tracking application.
It captures faces through a camera and automatically marks attendance.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- OpenCV
- Dlib
- Face Recognition (AI-based)
- NumPy
- AI

## Features
- Real-time face detection and recognition
- Automatic attendance marking
- Attendance stored in CSV file
- Reduces manual effort

## How to Run
1. Clone the repository
2. Install dependencies:
   pip install -r requirements.txt
3. Run the application:
   python app.py

## Applications
- Colleges and Schools
- Offices
- Secure Organizations
